Specification source
--------------------
The recipe layouts this mod draws reproduce what Create Fly's own recipe viewer
integration shows. Create Fly (https://modrinth.com/mod/create-fly) is released
under CC0-1.0, and its shipped JEI and RRV plugins were read as the
specification for slot positions, arrows, heat bars, chance outputs and which
picture-in-picture render state each category uses. No Create Fly source or
class file is copied into or redistributed by this mod; every class here is
this project's own.

Linked, not bundled
-------------------
Textures and translation keys are referenced from Create Fly's own jar by
identifier at runtime. Create's assets are All Rights Reserved and are not
redistributed here. This mod ships no assets of its own.

